OL,3,GNEWSAPolice custody death 'grossly
OL,4,Anegligent failure' - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has heard how a man died in
OL,7,Fpolice custody after a "criminally
OL,8,Fnegligent" duty nurse assumed he was
OL,9,Ffaking unconsciousness and failed to
OL,10,Fcheck his medical condition properly.
OL,12,FWilliam Cameron, 38, died of a heart
OL,13,Fattack caused by a mix of alcohol,
OL,14,Fmethadone and other drugs after he was
OL,15,Farrested on 8 January 2020, the Old
OL,16,FBailey heard.
OL,18,FSean Cregg, 36, who was the designated
OL,19,FHealth Care Professional working at
OL,20,FLoddon police station in Berkshire,
OL,21,Fdenies a charge of gross negligent
OL,22,Fmanslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
